        <zone custom-title='true' h='1100' id='11' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 13]' type-v2='paramctrl' w='10667' x='76067' y='9500'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Choose a Dimension</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7550' id='12' type-v2='text' w='86600' x='467' y='1550'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>How to Interpret the Data</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>The graph plots:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>X-axis:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Number of Items</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Y-axis:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Number of Orders</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>The chart is divided into </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>four quadrants</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>, each representing a unique relationship between the number of items offered and the number of orders received:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Top Right Quadrant:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> High Number of Orders / High Number of Items</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Top Left Quadrant:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> High Number of Orders / Low Number of Items</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Bottom Right Quadrant:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Low Number of Orders / High Number of Items</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Bottom Left Quadrant:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Low Number of Orders / Low Number of Items</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Focus: Top Right Quadrant — High Orders &amp; High Items</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>This quadrant indicates chains or cuisines offering a wide variety of items </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>and</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> generating a high number of orders.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>However, if a chain falls here but still shows lower conversions despite a large menu, it may point to issues related to perceived value or customer decision-making.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Possible Reasons:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Ineffective Combos:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> The combinations of items offered might not be appealing enough.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Pricing Concerns:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> Prices could be on the higher side, discouraging conversions despite the variety.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f6efe0' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='1125' id='13' mode='dropdown' name='Quadrants' param='[federated.1ywtcto0sz641x1bi356g1m8nj2q].[none:country_code:nk]' show-apply='true' type-v2='filter' values='cascading' w='10667' x='88333' y='6650' />
